d":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2022-02-13T19:22:53Z","updated_at":"2022-05-19T23:20:39Z","closed_at":"2022-05-19T23:20:39Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Neovim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.7.0-dev+1027-gf02a5a7bd\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nYes, Vim 8.2.4106\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nManjaro Linux x86_64\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nTerminator 2.1.1\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\nxterm-256color\n\n### Installation\n\nArch User Repository (AUR)\n\n### How to reproduce the issue\n\n1. Create the following config file `test.vim`:\r\n   ```vim\r\n   set shortmess+=A\r\n   ```\r\n2. `nvim --clean`\r\n3. `:w foo.txt`\r\n4. `:mksession session.vim`\r\n5. Keep this `nvim` session running and open a new terminal shell instance\r\n6. (in new terminal shell): `nvim -u test.vim`\r\n7. `:source session.vim`\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nNeovim respects `shortmess+=A` and does not give an error message.\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nNeovim gives an error message after sourcing `session.vim`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nError detected while processing /home/melker/.config/nvim/session.vim:\r\nline   14:\r\nE325: ATTENTION\r\nFound a swap file by the name \"[...]/foo.txt.swp\"\r\n[...]\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"zeertzjq","id":35768171,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NzY4MTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35768171?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq","html_url":"https://github.com/zeertzjq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeertzjq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeert